  "body": "Our vendor has already purchased their next home and is seriously motivated to see this sold! First home buyers, downsizers, and savvy investors take note: if you have been searching for a peaceful, private entry level property in a sought after Red Beach address, 26B Durness Place is an opportunity you cannot afford to miss.\r\n\r\nTucked quietly back from the road down a shared driveway, this perfectly presented two-bedroom cottage is nestled in native bush with its northern side wide open to capture all-day sun offering the ultimate private sanctuary. Inside, rich timber interiors give it a cosy, Lockwood style feel, complemented by a host of standout features:\r\n\r\n* Two Bedrooms with Deck Access: 2 double bedrooms, both opening directly onto the deck via ranch sliders.\r\n\r\n* Sun Soaked Open Plan Living: Light filled north facing living and dining spaces highlighted by two character bay windows with built in window seats, creating the ultimate spot to curl up with a book and your morning coffee.\r\n\r\n* Practical Galley Kitchen: A neat, functional galley style kitchen complete with gas cooking.\r\n\r\n* Indoor Outdoor Flow & Sea Peeps: Expansive wrap around decks run the length of the home, letting you soak up the north facing sun against a tranquil bush backdrop while enjoying a peek of the sea from both the living room and the deck.\r\n\r\n* Year Round Comfort: A contemporary bathroom featuring a full bathtub, plus a heat pump in the living area to keep you comfortable through every season.\r\n\r\n* Parking & Serious Storage: Includes a covered carport, additional off street parking, and a huge under house storage space, giving you plenty of room for all the tools, surfboards, and beach toys.\r\n\r\nLocation & Lifestyle:\r\nSituated at the start of the Peninsula, Red Beach is loved for its friendly community and relaxed seaside lifestyle. You are just a short drive from safe swimming and recreation at Red Beach while Orewa, Silverdale and Millwater shopping centres cover all your retail needs. Need to commute? The main arterial bus route is right on hand for an easy trip in either direction.\r\n\r\nWith our vendor committed elsewhere, genuine value is on offer here. Contact Dylan & Zoe from Team Turner today for more information or to arrange your viewing!\r\n\r\nAuction (unless sold prior) : Thursday 10 December 2026 On Site - let the agents know of your interest conditional or unconditional!",
